{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Gr\u00e9goire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/7746d5b4d2977b66777d7f305166b073.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You\u2019ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward\u2026 and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong>\u00a0: sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A good start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/f5103f73898a0fdd05407a6164a54a23b454d7c3.jpg"},{"name":"Congrats on your diploma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/293fc2a6c510bf8bb48636abf3889c2af33252a3.jpg"},{"name":"Rock Bottom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/cace267ade45a6255145d794a42d6ac954cf3eac.jpg"},{"name":"Young at heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/2c1733760fbd1d16eddf3faf1f688f7ec397fede.jpg"},{"name":"Masterpiece","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/96106a6434dfd706dc28fc077a61873547d65db1.jpg"},{"name":"Learn from your mistakes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/82097aa6d1deeee7a6d303652b821f9fcadf54c0.jpg"},{"name":"Boing Boing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/108244cab14d431a9338ba59b2dabf20f272d1db.jpg"},{"name":"Childplay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/02d72ec7ffca46d05136861322b2fa62f6da8be5.jpg"},{"name":"Fine Arts graduate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3814650/77cabd8afa23d541f98be1e0486875d401d5fe9c.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814650?t=1766011596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814650?t=1766011596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/625f97c2aa5214cbf96302363ad0f12d2cf153fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766011596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/625f97c2aa5214cbf96302363ad0f12d2cf153fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766011596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Gr\u00e9goire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/7746d5b4d2977b66777d7f305166b073.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You\u2019ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward\u2026 and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong>\u00a0: sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Campus ADN 2024-2025"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/50f35e088c23a00cd183c0d960870b2e56ccc685/header.jpg?t=1766011596","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814650/680288938/cf9c93d47850b511876864c698d1f10e0e044922/1752771081/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753294053","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814650/680288938/cf9c93d47850b511876864c698d1f10e0e044922/1752771081/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753294053","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814650/680288938/cf9c93d47850b511876864c698d1f10e0e044922/1752771081/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753294053","id":257158922,"name":"Bande Annonce Lancement Curyeux","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158922/2590008d5e78b16bfcf8899b727e97e280cf31d5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753294053"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814650/749098318/a743e6febc1415df67db9ae50cc769c3fb46f889/1753290053/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753294051","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814650/749098318/a743e6febc1415df67db9ae50cc769c3fb46f889/1753290053/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753294051","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814650/749098318/a743e6febc1415df67db9ae50cc769c3fb46f889/175